<h1 data-copy-en="Councilor Voss" data-copy-zh="Councilor Voss">Councilor Voss</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Councilor Voss’s office and understand his dialogue and connection to current mission objectives." data-copy-zh="找到 Councilor Voss 的办公室，了解拜访方式与相关任务的推进方向。">Find Councilor Voss’s office and understand his dialogue and connection to current mission objectives.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Meet Councilor Voss</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Find the Councilor’s Office</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Follow the mission you are on</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">What you can do here</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If access is blocked</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">认识 Councilor Voss</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">怎么到议员办公室</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">按当前任务继续</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">这里可以做什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">被挡在门外时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><h2>Meet Councilor Voss</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Councilor Voss — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/councilor-voss.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Councilor Voss — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/councilor-voss.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Councilor Voss — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Councilor Voss oversees Fringe Zone resource allocation from his office at Synergy Corp. His appearances support the Future setting and Syndicate missions.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Find the Councilor’s Office</h2><p>Go to <strong>Future → Prime Sector → Synergy Corp Lobby</strong> and choose <strong>To the Councilor’s Office</strong>. The move costs no time. Saber checks your access; the office becomes reachable after explicit access permission or completed <strong>Story Beat 76</strong>.</p><p>Once inside, Voss is present <strong>all day, every day</strong>.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Follow the mission you are on</h2><p>Voss does not have a separate personal relationship route. If a Syndicate objective involves the councilor, continue that mission through its own characters and locations; visiting Voss early does not bypass its prerequisites.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>What you can do here</h2><p>Select his portrait to hear his remarks. He has <strong>no direct Talk, gift, training, dating or Heart-to-Heart actions</strong>. You do not need to build ordinary affection to finish this visit.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>If access is blocked</h2><p>Return to your current main-story or Syndicate objective when Saber blocks the office. Repeating visits or searching for a gift does not grant the missing access.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">Chaos Syndicate — mission sequence</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Main story — current requirements</a></li><li><a href="character-saber.html">Saber — Synergy Corp access</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations — Future districts</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><h2>认识 Councilor Voss</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Councilor Voss 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/councilor-voss.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Councilor Voss 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/councilor-voss.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Councilor Voss 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Councilor Voss 在 新能集公司的办公室负责边缘区资源分配。他的出场与未来地区和辛迪加任务有关。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>怎么到议员办公室</h2><p>前往<strong>未来 → 核心区 → 新能集公司大厅</strong>，选择前往议员办公室，移动不消耗时间。Saber 会检查通行条件；获得明确通行许可，或完成<strong>主线第 76 节</strong>后即可进入。</p><p>办公室开放后，Voss<strong>每天全天都在里面</strong>。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>按当前任务继续</h2><p>Voss 没有独立的个人关系路线。若辛迪加目标涉及他，请沿该任务的相关角色与地点继续，提前拜访办公室不会跳过前置条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>这里可以做什么</h2><p>点开头像可以听到他的发言，目前<strong>没有直接交谈、赠礼、训练、约会或谈心行动</strong>。完成这次拜访不需要培养普通好感。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>被挡在门外时</h2><p>Saber 不允许进入时，先回到当前主线或辛迪加目标继续推进。反复拜访或寻找礼物不能代替通行条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><h2>接下来可以查阅</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">混沌辛迪加：任务顺序</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线：当前条件</a></li><li><a href="character-saber.html">Saber：新能集公司通行</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">地点：未来各地区</a></li></ul></section>
